    'footer.html': '<b>Weather data by <a href="https://open-meteo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open-Meteo.com</a></b> (<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>; ECMWF, NOAA GFS, DWD ICON, GEM, Météo-France, UKMO, JMA, CMA, BOM, KNMI, DMI, MET Norway models) and <b><a href="https://api.met.no/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MET Norway</a></b> (CC BY 4.0). History and verification: ERA5 / Copernicus reanalysis via Open-Meteo. Observations: METAR reports via the NOAA Aviation Weather Center. Map: <a href="https://www.kartverket.no/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">© Kartverket</a> (CC BY 4.0) and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener">© OpenStreetMap contributors</a>; place names © OpenStreetMap contributors (Nominatim). "Measured nearby" uses publicly shared private weather stations from <a href="https://weathermap.netatmo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Netatmo</a>.<br>The probabilities reflect the agreement between models and are <b>not an official forecast</b> – never use them for safety-critical decisions. Free, no ads, no accounts. Based on <a href="https://github.com/santonoreg/weather_forecast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WeFo</a> by santonoreg. <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> Figure in the shadow map: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Man_Waving_Hand_GIF_Animation_Loop_(large).gif" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Videoplasty.com / Wikimedia Commons</a> (<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, scaled down).',
